WEBVTT

00:25:27.246 --> 00:25:31.327
it's also providing 
the generation of entrepreneurs

00:25:31.327 --> 00:25:34.090
the ability to really 
get through programs

00:25:34.090 --> 00:25:36.530
like "Stars of science,"
which I have mentioned,

00:25:36.530 --> 00:25:40.386
and then provide the platform 
where you complete that equation,

00:25:40.386 --> 00:25:41.395
if you would like,

00:25:41.395 --> 00:25:44.930
taking the young generation 
from the schools who are learning Arabic

00:25:44.930 --> 00:25:47.150
up to you having an idea,

00:25:47.150 --> 00:25:49.780
and you can be able 
to present it to the globe.

00:25:51.160 --> 00:25:53.262
So, to be honest, I am excited ...

00:25:57.007 --> 00:26:02.543
the most exciting one is to see 
those young entrepreneurs on the stage